<h2>3. Speechify — Best for Listening, Not Producing</h2>
<p>Speechify is the tool to pick when the job is consumption: turning articles, PDFs, Google Docs and emails into audio you can listen to at up to 5x speed. Premium includes 1,000+ voices across 60+ languages, scan-and-listen for physical pages, AI summaries and cloud integrations; the free tier is limited to 1.5x speed and ten basic voices.</p>
<p>That distinction matters when comparing prices: Premium is $29/month or $139 billed yearly (roughly $11.58/month), and it buys a reading experience, not a production pipeline. If you need a voiceover file to drop into a video, ElevenLabs or Descript is the right purchase — Speechify Studio is the separate product for that.</p>

