<h2>4. Murf — Best Pay-As-You-Go TTS</h2>
<p>Murf's current pricing page leads with its API rather than studio subscriptions: a free trial with $10 of API credit, then pay-as-you-go at $0.01 per 1,000 characters on the Falcon 2.1 model and $0.03 per 1,000 on Gen2, with speech-to-text at $0.24 per hour and voice conversion at $0.10 per minute. Purchased credit does not expire, which is unusual in this category and useful for sporadic projects.</p>
<p>For creators, Murf's studio product covers 150+ voices across 35+ languages with per-word emphasis and pacing controls — the kind of granularity that matters for explainer voiceover. Confirm current studio pricing on murf.ai, since the API and studio plan pages are published separately.</p>

