<h2>5. Kits AI — Best for Music and Singing Voices</h2>
<p>Kits AI is built for musicians rather than narrators: instant and professional voice cloning, a voice designer and blender for creating voices that do not exist, and voice-to-voice conversion that re-sings an existing take in a different voice. Choir and harmony tools are part of the paid tiers, which is the giveaway that this is a music product.</p>
<p>Free allows 15 conversion minutes with a voice designer but zero voice slots and no downloads. Starter is $10/month for 2 voice slots, 60 conversion minutes and 15 download minutes; Producer is $30/month for unlimited conversion and 60 download minutes; Professional is $60/month for unlimited downloads. Note that cancelling freezes your cloned voices rather than deleting them — they return if you resubscribe.</p>

